 wrong:["Uric acid: rhomboid/rosette crystals, radiolucent, pH &lt;5.5","Calcium oxalate: monohydrate dumbbell/needle, dihydrate envelope (bipyramidal) — นิ่วบ่อยที่สุด","Struvite (MgNH4PO4): coffin-lid crystals, urease-producing bacteria (Proteus), staghorn","Calcium phosphate: amorphous/wedge-shaped prism, alkaline urine"],
