 gray:"A 60-year-old man undergoes abdominal CT for evaluation of flank discomfort. Imaging reveals a renal cystic lesion with contrast enhancement in the kidney. What is the most appropriate management? — A. Observation with periodic ultrasound B. Percutaneous aspiration C. Antibiotic therapy D. Surgical excision of the renal mass E. Percutaneous drainage",
